    "updated_at": "2018-02-05T18:35:31Z",
    "body": "This is just editorial, but the caveat here is that a feature cleanup will likely point out that disowning is not actually used by noreferrer/noopener per https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/1826#issuecomment-363177635. They control whether a browsing context has an opener browsing context (i.e., whether it's auxiliary).",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
