    "created_at": "2018-02-05T20:07:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-05T20:07:29Z",
    "body": "Maybe I am misreading the output of http://w3c-test.org/html/browsers/windows/auxiliary-browsing-contexts/opener-setter.window.html then?\r\n\r\nSetting window.opener to undefined -> assert_equals: expected (string) \"x\" but got (undefined) undefined\r\n\r\nSeems to indicate window.opener cannot be set to undefined for e.g. WebKit ToT is failing all 7 checks even though I had updated our implementation to match the spec very recently (or so I thought).",
    "author_association": "NONE",
