    "created_at": "2018-02-05T20:18:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-05T20:18:29Z",
    "body": "Oh, it looks like it is the very last check that is failing in WebKit:\r\nopenerSet(\"x\");\r\nassert_equals(win.opener, \"x\");\r\n\r\nSomehow, calling the original property setter, after the property has been set (and thus defineOwnProperty has been called) does not actually update the property anymore. I don't fully understand the issue here but OK.\r\n\r\nAt least, I was wrong that the test expects the property to no longer be replaceable.",
